{"id":"eh-0bw","title":"agy did not install in the container","description":"The Antigravity CLI installer in postCreate.sh failed and only warned: agy is not on PATH and ~/.local/bin has no agy. SPEC-12 and BUILD-12 (Antigravity host) depend on it, and the keyring login-persistence check can't run without it. Recorded in README.md → Host availability. Found in the P0B follow-up review.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:07:43.338905942Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:29:18.129579557Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:29:18.129205661Z","close_reason":"Fixed by eh-devcontainer-install-p64 in de08b74: run_installer decompresses the gzipped installer; agy 1.3.1 installed and agy --version passes","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"eh-0bw","depends_on_id":"eh-p0b-zbd","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:07:43.338905942Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
{"id":"eh-1tj","title":"Tool PATH is set only for interactive bash","description":"postCreate.sh adds ~/.local/bin and node_modules/.bin to PATH only in ~/.bashrc, which returns early in non-interactive shells. make, sh -c and CI won't find br, shellspec, agy or codex. P1's gate must set PATH itself, or devcontainer.json should set it with remoteEnv. Found in the P0B follow-up review.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:07:43.285668288Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:32:46.616359256Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:32:46.615928329Z","close_reason":"Verified after rebuild: remoteEnv PATH (de08b74) active; br shellspec agy muse codex promptfoo all resolve under sh -c","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"eh-1tj","depends_on_id":"eh-p0b-zbd","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:07:43.285668288Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}],"comments":[{"id":1,"issue_id":"eh-1tj","author":"vscode","text":"Fix committed in de08b74 (eh-devcontainer-install-p64): PATH set via remoteEnv in devcontainer.json. Waits for a rebuild. After rebuilding, run sh -c 'command -v br shellspec agy muse codex promptfoo'; close this bead if all six resolve.","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:29:18Z"}]}
