{"id":"eh-claude-autoupdate-cqu","title":"Claude Code updates itself, so its version can change mid-experiment","description":"Found in P1 on 2026-10-08: the claude binary was replaced by an auto-update at 20:17 while 'claude --version' ran, and was briefly not on PATH. A version change between runs is a rival ('runs made under different hosts or versions'). SPEC-04 should read the version per trial and decide whether to disable auto-update (e.g. DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER) for runs.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T20:23:47.931747521Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T20:23:47.931747521Z","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["spec-04"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"eh-claude-autoupdate-cqu","depends_on_id":"eh-p1-l9w","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-10-08T20:23:47.931747521Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
