{"id":"eh-codex-install-vih","title":"Install the Codex CLI from a pinned release in install/codex.sh","description":"Codex comes only from npm: promptfoo -> @openai/codex-sdk@^0.156.1 -> @openai/codex, so the container is stuck at 0.156.1 and codex shows an update banner. Add .devcontainer/install/codex.sh: the pinned static musl release (0.162.0) with SHA-256 pinned per arch, like beads_rust.sh, installed to ~/.local/bin/codex, which comes before node_modules/.bin on PATH. Required host: a failed download fails the container. Offline ShellSpec tests: skip at the pinned version, re-download at another, fail on download failure, fail on checksum mismatch. Done needs codex.sh run for real and command -v codex resolving to ~/.local/bin/codex at 0.162.0.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:45:09.010566402Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:46:23.464558085Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:46:23.463982535Z","close_reason":"Done in 7f5051f","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"]}
{"id":"eh-codex-package-6sd","title":"install/codex.sh installs the bare binary, which 0.162.0's interactive TUI rejects","description":"After a container rebuild, running codex prints 'this CLI has no complete local package; install a packaged Codex CLI or use the standalone installer'. codex exec still works. The release's codex-package-<target>.tar.gz holds the layout the TUI needs (bin/, codex-resources/ with bwrap, codex-path/ with rg, codex-package.json).","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:58:12.916738984Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:59:14.666778175Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:59:14.666380683Z","close_reason":"Fixed: codex.sh installs codex-package-<target>.tar.gz and links ~/.local/bin/codex to it","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"eh-codex-package-6sd","depends_on_id":"eh-codex-install-vih","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:58:12.916738984Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
{"id":"eh-codex-path-override-4qc","title":"Point promptfoo's codex-sdk provider at the installed Codex CLI","description":"npm ci still installs @openai/codex@0.156.1, and the SDK finds that copy with require.resolve and ignores PATH. Evals would run 0.156.1 while the shell runs ~/.local/bin/codex. The harness's openai:codex-sdk provider config sets codex_path_override to the installed binary (promptfoo dist codex-sdk-*.js:86,439). Gate test: the provider drives the installed CLI (SDK 0.156.1 against a newer CLI may break on protocol changes). Check what codex_path_override changes in promptfoo's cost calculation (:1177). Belongs with BUILD-04's Codex adapter.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:45:09.055461080Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:45:11.570862334Z","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"eh-codex-path-override-4qc","depends_on_id":"eh-build-04-05d","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:45:11.570348733Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"eh-codex-path-override-4qc","depends_on_id":"eh-codex-install-vih","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:45:11.510630378Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
