{"id":"eh-d69","title":"CLAUDE.md repeats PROMPTS.md Shared context","description":"CLAUDE.md is loaded into every session, but most of it (the description, the Tracking summary, Scope and Writing) repeats PROMPTS.md → Shared context. Cut it to the rules a one-off session needs, and point to PROMPTS.md and the beads-sdd skill for the rest. Found after the P0B follow-up.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:10:18.058577329Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:13:17.731054397Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:13:17.730490825Z","close_reason":"CLAUDE.md cut to the one-off rules, with pointers to PROMPTS.md and beads-sdd","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"eh-d69","depends_on_id":"eh-p0b-zbd","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:10:18.058577329Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
{"id":"eh-daily-routine-pco","title":"Record the daily working routine in docs/arch/spec-process.md","description":"The user asked for the session loop (next prompt, who does what per prompt type, end-of-session check, side findings, br commands) to be written down. P2 lists spec-process.md for this; write it early so P2 extends it instead of duplicating it.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:49:12.738318266Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:49:31.030788119Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:49:31.030413477Z","close_reason":"Done in 5394a53","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"]}
{"id":"eh-defer-opencode-vt4","title":"Defer OpenCode as a host until the core harness works on the other four","description":"OpenCode is deferred until the core harness works with Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity CLI and Muse Code. PROMPTS.md (Hosts, Subsystems) and README mark it deferred; SPEC-11 and BUILD-11 are deferred in br. Install in postCreate.sh and the login volume in devcontainer.json are kept, so bringing it back is removing the mark in PROMPTS.md and undeferring the two beads.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:52:16.205462577Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:53:16.017044487Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:53:16.016625807Z","close_reason":"OpenCode deferred; SPEC-11 and BUILD-11 deferred","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"]}
{"id":"eh-devcontainer-install-p64","title":"Split curl installers out of postCreate.sh into .devcontainer/install/","description":"postCreate.sh installs curl-fetched tools three ways: install-br.sh, ShellSpec's inline download, run_installer for agy and muse. Move each into .devcontainer/install/{lib,beads_rust,shellspec,antigravity,muse}.sh, each runnable by hand and a no-op at the pinned version; keep apt, npm, statusline, ownership and PATH inline. lib.sh's run_installer decompresses gzip bodies served without Content-Encoding (the cause of eh-0bw). Fix eh-1tj in the PATH step. Offline ShellSpec tests stub curl and binaries via PATH: gzip handling, skip-when-present, warn (agy, muse) vs fail (br, shellspec) on download failure. Done needs antigravity.sh run for real and agy --version passing.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:20:08.359118296Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T19:29:18.078524961Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T19:29:18.078119659Z","close_reason":"Done in de08b74","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"eh-devcontainer-install-p64","depends_on_id":"eh-0bw","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-10-08T19:20:08.359118296Z","created_by":"vscode","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
{"id":"eh-devcontainer-install-rest-58y","title":"Move OpenCode and the shell toolchain installs into .devcontainer/install/","description":"postCreate.sh installs OpenCode (npm -g, pinned) and the shell toolchain (apt) inline, while every other tool has a script under .devcontainer/install/. Add install/opencode.sh and install/shell_toolchain.sh, each runnable by hand and a no-op when already installed, with offline ShellSpec tests. Asked for by the user for consistency.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-10-08T20:10:17.726849161Z","created_by":"vscode","updated_at":"2026-10-08T20:11:46.302621316Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T20:11:46.302176197Z","close_reason":"Fixed directly: install/opencode.sh and install/shell_toolchain.sh","source_repo":"eval-coding-agent-harness","source_repo_path":"/workspaces/eval-coding-agent-harness","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["harness"]}
